Using the System
Application
The examples in this section are intended to
demonstrate how the Sanga identity behaves
across real-world communication scenarios.
They should be approached as working
reference points rather than fixed templates.
In most cases, stronger results will come from
maintaining consistency in typography, hierarchy,
spacing, colour relationships, and overall
restraint rather than introducing entirely new
visual approaches for each communication.
As new formats, events, and campaigns
emerge over time, the identity can
continue evolving gradually while
remaining recognisable and coherent.




